# The SPICE tab. draw-sim-legend fed gpu-rect's RETURN VALUE back as the next
# triangle index (everywhere else the index is advanced by hand), so the
# legend text was written over the menubar's triangles and the frame's
# triangle count collapsed -- the whole plot vanished and the menubar text
# with it. Pins the plot, the traces, the legend and the restored menubar.
#
# Re-minted 2026-07-28. The image recorded at CL 9766 had LED1 as a flat line
# at 0 V: draw-sim-led-steps alternates its 20 segments between gy + gh / 4 and
# gy + gh - 20 on i / 2 * 2 == i, and in that recording the parity test never
# fired, so every segment landed on the low level. opening.codex has not
# changed since (the only edit is one em-dash in a prose line at CL 11522), so
# what moved is the compiler. Against the current seed the expression answers
# 1,0,1,0,1,0 for i = 0..5 and led-y answers 181 / 461 / 181, which are exactly
# the two rows that differed. The VCC and NRST traces, which use no parity
# test, were byte-identical across the re-mint and are the control.

boot 8000
click 260 40
settle 1500
